A field one alternative of a disjunctive source leaves optional is optional,
whatever the other alternatives say, so it cannot be moved into a field the
target requires without a fallback.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {kind!: "a", n!: int} | {kind!: "b", n?: int}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
Schema: {count!: int}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {count: v0_0.n}
}
-- out/error --
error[E0343]: n is optional in 0.0 and 1.0 requires count: write _coalesce(v0_0.n, <fallback>) to say what to use when it is absent
 --> history/1.0.thema:5:9
  |
5 |     v1_0: {count: v0_0.n}
  |            ^^^^^
  |
